{"path":"language/bool_constant","title":"Predefined Boolean constants (since C23)","titleHtml":"Predefined Boolean constants <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/language/bool_constant","section":"language","kind":"page","summary":"Keywords true and false represent predefined constants. They are non-lvalues of type bool.","html":"<h3 id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</h3>\n<table class=\"t-sdsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>true</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> (1)\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>false</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> (2)\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Explanation\">Explanation</h3>\n<p>Keywords <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> represent predefined constants. They are <a href=\"/w/c/language/value_category#Non-lvalue_object_expressions\">non-lvalues</a> of type <a href=\"/w/c/language/type\"><code>bool</code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>See <a href=\"/w/c/language/conversion#Integer_conversions\">integral conversions</a> for implicit conversions from <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">bool</span> to other types and <a href=\"/w/c/language/conversion#Boolean_conversion\">boolean conversions</a> for the implicit conversions from other types to <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">bool</span>.\n</p><p>Until C23, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> were implemented as macros provided in <a href=\"/w/c/types\"><code>&lt;stdbool.h&gt;</code></a>. An implementation may also define <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">bool</span>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> as predefined macros in C23 for compatibility.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;assert.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw407\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 6.4.4.6 Predefined constants (p: 66)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/bool_literal\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Boolean literals</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Syntax","id":"Syntax"},{"depth":3,"text":"Explanation","id":"Explanation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"language","title":"C language"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Predefined Boolean constants (since C23)","children":[{"label":"Syntax"},{"label":"Explanation","note":"Keywords true and false represent predefined constants. They are non-lvalues of type bool."},{"label":"Notes","note":"See integral conversions for implicit conversions from bool to other types and boolean conversions for the implicit conversions from other types to bool."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C23"],"wordCount":106,"codeBlockCount":1}
